---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="What Are Your Teacher Qualifications? | Marietta Childcare"
  description="Learn about Marietta Childcare's educator credentials, training, certifications, and background checks.">
  <section class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden w-screen -ml-[calc((100vw-100%)/2)]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/Background_Images/infant_tummy_time_teacher_hand_background.jpg" 
        alt="Teacher qualifications" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">What Are Your Teacher Qualifications?</h1>
      <p class="text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl text-white drop-shadow-md">Educator credentials, training, certifications, and background checks ensuring quality care.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">Marietta Childcare invests in professional educators who are committed to children's development. Marietta Childcare's teaching staff brings expertise, training, and passion for early childhood education.</p>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Educational Requirements</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's teachers meet Georgia childcare licensing requirements for education and training. Teachers at Marietta Childcare hold certifications in early childhood education or related fields. Marietta Childcare's staff includes educators with degrees in child development, education, and psychology.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's educational requirements exceed minimum licensing standards. Marietta Childcare prioritizes hiring teachers with advanced degrees and specialized training. The teaching staff at Marietta Childcare brings diverse educational backgrounds and expertise.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Certifications and Credentials</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's teachers maintain current certifications in early childhood education. Certifications at Marietta Childcare include CPR and First Aid training. Marietta Childcare's staff holds credentials from recognized early childhood organizations.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's teachers pursue specialized certifications in areas such as infant care, special needs, and language development. Credential requirements at Marietta Childcare ensure teachers have current, relevant training. Marietta Childcare's commitment to professional credentials supports quality teaching.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Professional Development</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare invests in ongoing professional development for all staff. Professional development at Marietta Childcare includes training on curriculum, child development, and teaching strategies. Marietta Childcare's staff participates in workshops, conferences, and online courses.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's professional development program supports teachers' growth and expertise. Teachers at Marietta Childcare receive training in emerging best practices in early childhood education. Marietta Childcare's commitment to professional development strengthens teaching quality.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Experience and Background</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's teachers bring extensive experience working with young children. Experience requirements at Marietta Childcare ensure teachers have practical knowledge of child development. Marietta Childcare's staff includes teachers with 5, 10, 15+ years of experience in early childhood education.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's hiring process prioritizes candidates with strong backgrounds in child development. Background checks at Marietta Childcare verify teaching history and professional references. Marietta Childcare's experienced staff provides quality care and education.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Specialized Training</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's teachers receive specialized training in various areas. Specialized training at Marietta Childcare includes infant care, toddler development, and preschool curriculum. Marietta Childcare's staff receives training in special needs inclusion and differentiated instruction.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's teachers are trained in positive discipline, social-emotional learning, and trauma-informed practices. Training at Marietta Childcare covers curriculum implementation and assessment. Marietta Childcare's specialized training ensures quality instruction across all age groups.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Ongoing Assessment and Evaluation</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare evaluates teacher performance regularly. Teacher evaluations at Marietta Childcare include classroom observations and feedback. Marietta Childcare's assessment process identifies professional development needs and recognizes excellence.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's teachers receive constructive feedback to support continuous improvement. Evaluation at Marietta Childcare is aligned with early childhood education standards. Marietta Childcare's commitment to teacher quality ensures excellent care and education.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Passion for Early Childhood Education</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's teachers are passionate about supporting children's development. Teachers at Marietta Childcare are committed to creating nurturing, engaging learning environments. Marietta Childcare's staff believes in the importance of quality early childhood education.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's teachers model positive behaviors and build strong relationships with children. The teaching staff at Marietta Childcare creates a home away from home environment. Marietta Childcare's teachers are dedicated to helping children reach their highest potential.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Collaboration and Communication</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's teachers collaborate with families and colleagues. Teacher collaboration at Marietta Childcare includes regular team meetings and planning sessions. Marietta Childcare's staff communicates effectively with families about children's progress.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's teachers work together to support children's development and learning. Collaboration at Marietta Childcare includes consultation with specialists and support staff. Marietta Childcare's collaborative approach ensures comprehensive support for all children.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-lg mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Meet Our Teaching Staff</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">Marietta Childcare welcomes families to meet the teaching staff during tours. Schedule a tour at Marietta Childcare to learn about our educators and how they support your child's development.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition">Schedule a Tour</a>
        </section>

        <nav class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Related Pages</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li><a href="/faq/curriculum" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">What's Your Curriculum?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/faq/safety-security" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">How Safe Is Your Facility?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/about" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">About Marietta Childcare</a></li>
            <li><a href="/programs" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Our Programs</a></li>
            <li><a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Contact Marietta Childcare</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
